{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_05AE9AFE","title":"Edison  Mr Delivery Man","entry":"Dlg_05AE9AFE::entry","exit":"Dlg_05AE9AFE::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_274A3C11","articyId":"72057619807780379","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Edison Mattix","text":"Well, looks like you're putting more than a fresh coat of paint on this place.","speakerId":"Ntt_5057514D","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well, looks like you're putting more than a fresh coat of paint on this place.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":-375.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"51320","byteOffset":33829456,"byteLength":424}},{"id":"DFr_FC9CAEA1","articyId":"72057619807780428","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Edison Mattix","text":"Of course I knew him. I've delivered to him for almost five years. Did he talk about how we helped each other?","speakerId":"Ntt_5057514D","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Of course I knew him. I've delivered to him for almost five years. Did he talk about how we helped each other?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":1475.0,"y":-25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48263","byteOffset":32595192,"byteLength":456}},{"id":"DFr_CE71B84A","articyId":"72057619807780434","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Edison Mattix","text":"He was always rambling about some grand idea or another. Little out there but still, one of the few people I consider - considered? - a friend.","speakerId":"Ntt_5057514D","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"He was always rambling about some grand idea or another. Little out there but still, one of the few people I consider - considered? - a friend.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":2100.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44955","byteOffset":31340856,"byteLength":452}},{"id":"DFr_7B1C5280","articyId":"72057619807780440","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Edison Mattix","text":"Nah. He only spoke of the big picture stuff, not little details. I'm assuming he left you the stand? Admirable.","speakerId":"Ntt_5057514D","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Nah. He only spoke of the big picture stuff, not little details. I'm assuming he left you the stand? Admirable.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":2750.0,"y":675.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18594","byteOffset":14921304,"byteLength":420}},{"id":"DFr_C0F7D9B1","articyId":"72057619807780455","type":"choice","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Player","text":"Yeah...","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yeah...","TextSheVersion":"Yeah...","TextTheyVersion":"Yeah..."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3075.0,"y":700.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33348","byteOffset":20501056,"byteLength":316}},{"id":"DFr_141FA9F0","articyId":"72057619807780493","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Edison Mattix","text":"And the debt to go with it?","speakerId":"Ntt_5057514D","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"And the debt to go with it?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":3375.0,"y":700.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"34340","byteOffset":20874368,"byteLength":372}},{"id":"DFr_C3717B7C","articyId":"72057619807780514","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Edison Mattix","text":"Thaddeus didn't lose much sleep worrying about profitability. He seemed more worried about keeping his old pals, like Banor, in work. He even slipped me some cash when I was down on my luck.","speakerId":"Ntt_5057514D","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Thaddeus didn't lose much sleep worrying about profitability. He seemed more worried about keeping his old pals, like Banor, in work. He even slipped me some cash when I was down on my luck.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":4550.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"51454","byteOffset":33881240,"byteLength":500}},{"id":"DFr_9F5AD212","articyId":"72057619807780520","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Edison Mattix","text":"Yeah, well, you're hardly the only one. It's a rotten system.","speakerId":"Ntt_5057514D","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yeah, well, you're hardly the only one. It's a rotten system.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":3975.0,"y":775.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18165","byteOffset":14759312,"byteLength":372}},{"id":"DFr_6F79F45A","articyId":"72057619807780580","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Edison Mattix","text":"Look, I gotta run. I'll put together Thaddeus's typical order and swing it through in a couple days. Bring you something extra. Something a little... hard to come by. My way of welcoming you to the grind.","speakerId":"Ntt_5057514D","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Look, I gotta run. I'll put together Thaddeus's typical order and swing it through in a couple days. Bring you something extra. Something a little... hard to come by. My way of welcoming you to the grind.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":4850.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42118","byteOffset":30260552,"byteLength":536}},{"id":"DFr_A2021888","articyId":"72057619807781120","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Edison Mattix","text":"He really did it, huh? He's gone, right? Like gone gone.","speakerId":"Ntt_5057514D","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"He really did it, huh? He's gone, right? Like gone gone.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":874.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32139","byteOffset":20039264,"byteLength":444}},{"id":"DFr_1F139D46","articyId":"72057619807780385","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Who are you?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Who are you?","TextSheVersion":"Who are you?","TextTheyVersion":"Who are you?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":-50.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28952","byteOffset":18836440,"byteLength":292}},{"id":"DFr_D4654E59","articyId":"72057619807780391","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Something like that.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Something like that.","TextSheVersion":"Something like that.","TextTheyVersion":"Something like that."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":-50.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48499","byteOffset":32683136,"byteLength":300}},{"id":"DFr_2A265F87","articyId":"72057619807780399","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Edison Mattix","text":"Name's Edison Mattix. Don't call me Ed or Matty and we'll be good as glass. I do deliveries for Conland Containers. You know, Judy's company? I hadn't heard from Thaddeus in a while so I thought I'd swing by.","speakerId":"Ntt_5057514D","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Name's Edison Mattix. Don't call me Ed or Matty and we'll be good as glass. I do deliveries for Conland Containers. You know, Judy's company? I hadn't heard from Thaddeus in a while so I thought I'd swing by.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":275.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33115","byteOffset":20411008,"byteLength":488}},{"id":"DFr_F52F2D33","articyId":"72057619807780407","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"You knew Thaddeus?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You knew Thaddeus?","TextSheVersion":"You knew Thaddeus?","TextTheyVersion":"You knew Thaddeus?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1200.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28700","byteOffset":18740912,"byteLength":300}},{"id":"DFr_57557999","articyId":"72057619807780413","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Did he say anything before he left?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Did he say anything before he left?","TextSheVersion":"Did he say anything before he left?","TextTheyVersion":"Did he say anything before he left?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1200.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"46573","byteOffset":31951840,"byteLength":316}},{"id":"DFr_53FB0562","articyId":"72057619807780419","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Do you know where he